sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Timer(3600s)
    participant BM as BookmarkManager
    participant NS as NetworkService
    participant MC as MessageCenterStore
    participant NM as NotificationManager

    T->>BM: checkBookmarkedArticlesForUpdates(manual:)
    BM->>BM: 取有 articleId 的前 12（手动）/ 10（自动）条
    loop 每条
        alt 无缓存正文
            BM->>BM: 计 skipped
        else 有缓存正文
            BM->>NS: fetchArticleDetail(articleId:)
            BM->>BM: firstIndex 重新定位（:573）
            BM->>BM: isMeaningfulUpdate(old, new)? → updated / unchanged
        end
    end
    alt updatedItems 非空 且 pushOnUpdate
        BM->>BM: sendUpdateNotifications()（最多 3 条）
        BM->>MC: ingest(kind: .bookmarkUpdate, id: "bookmark-update-{readKey}")
        MC->>MC: 落盘 messageCenterEvents.json
        MC->>MC: syncBadge()（防抖 300ms）
    end
    Note over BM: 用户点击该通知 → NM.handleNotificationTap<br/>isBookmarkUpdate=true → markRead(kind: .bookmarkUpdate)
